    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52734" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλιστ-εύω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλλιστος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be the
				finest</i> or <i>most beautiful</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.196
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				226
			</span></i> (lyr.); of animals, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				163
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλιστεύσει πασέων τῶν γυναικῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.61
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.180
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῶρ᾽ ἃ καλλιστεύεται τῶν νῦν ἐν
					ἀνθρώποισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					947
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ba.</u>
				409
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1009
			</span></i>: pf.
			part.
			
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγώνων τῶν κεκαλλιστευμένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Oen.</u>
					p.39A.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεκ. θέαμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procop.
					<u>Aed.</u>
					1.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
